Chitrakote: a Living Screencast

Made entirely in code: every frame, note and sound effect is generated by the source in this folder.

Fonts
- Inter (Regular, Medium, SemiBold, Bold), The Inter Project Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (fonts/OFL.txt). https://github.com/rsms/inter

Voice
- Narration synthesised with Kokoro-82M (voice bf_emma) via kokoro-onnx, Apache License 2.0. https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M · https://github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx

Music and foley
- Original score and procedural foley synthesised with numpy/scipy (no samples).

Facts
- See FACTS.md for every claim and its source.

The planner app "Pagdandi" and the character Pip are original and fictional.
